  "description": "SpectralGPT is the first universal remote sensing foundation model purpose-built for spectral remote sensing images, using a novel 3D generative pretrained transformer (GPT) architecture. It is trained on over one million Sentinel-2 spectral images, supports progressive training on diverse datasets, and achieves state-of-the-art results on multiple downstream tasks including classification, segmentation, and change detection.",
